      "writtenOn": "2024-05-24T20:50:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would like to ask for an exception here.\nthe \u0027Instant\u0027 is epoch time, it is different from this.\nwe use this timestamp to align with UWB too.https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Uwb/framework/java/android/uwb/RangingMeasurement.java;l\u003d133 and other location related API.\n\nAlso, we will use a Genaric ranging API to wrap UWB and channel sounding; using the consistent timestamp is easy to extend and maintain.",
