      "writtenOn": "2024-05-24T23:10:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`java.time.Instant` doesn\u0027t interop well with `SystemClock.elapsedRealTimeNanos`.\n\nTo translate from the elapsedRealTimeNanos:\n```\nlong nanosSinceBoot \u003d SystemClock.elapsedRealTimeNanos();\nInstant myInstant \u003d Instant.MIN.plusNanos(nanosSinceBoot);\n```\n\nSo it\u0027s entirely possible to convert it seems (I\u0027d advise trying to be sure it does work as expected).  I\u0027ll defer to @wescande@google.com since I\u0027m just an interloper from another team providing API feedback.",
